# [DD-13b.W1.1 r46sem finding 13] `description ` -- ONE TRAILING SPACE,
# NO TEXT. Legs B and C already accept an empty description here; leg A
# used to hard-error "'description' needs its text", which is false of
# this line (it has a description, it is merely empty). All three must
# accept it identically.
pattern a+
description 
m "aaa" 0 3
